Error [E0112]: `Reader.take` wants Int (a whole number), but this is U64 (a 64-bit whole number, 0 to 18446744073709551615)
  --> tests/ui/reader_take_sized_int.jet:7:20
    |
  7 |     tail :: r.take(count) ?? panic("short")
    |                    ^^^^^
 Why: every argument must match its parameter's type
 Fix: widen it explicitly with `Int.from_u64(value)`
